---
// ConversationStrip — "A day with it" (homepage § III). Four beats from a
// real workday: the morning brief, an automatic work-log entry, a decision
// captured in one line, and Sunday's staleness flag + /weekly-review.
//
// Static, monospace, CSS-only. No fabricated behavior — every line mirrors
// the shipped playbooks: thinkos-morning.md, session-capture.md,
// thinkos-capture.md (decision mode), thinkos-session-start.sh and
// weekly-review.md.
---
<section class="border-t border-rule">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-6 md:px-10 py-20 md:py-28">

    <header class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 mb-12 reveal">
      <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-3">
        <p class="section-numeral" aria-hidden="true">III</p>
        <p class="kicker mt-5">§ III</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-8 md:col-start-5">
        <h2 class="display text-3xl md:text-5xl">A day with it</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-[17px] md:text-[18px] leading-relaxed text-muted max-w-[60ch]">
          Four moments. One command in the morning, one line when you decide
          something, and the rest happens on its own.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-rule border border-rule reveal">

      <!-- BEAT 1 — morning -->
      <article class="bg-paper p-6 md:p-7 flex flex-col hover-card">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between border-b border-rule pb-3 mb-3">
          <p class="kicker">08:40 · Morning</p>
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-muted">one command</p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted mb-4">
          The brief: focus, plate, who you're waiting on — under 250 words.
        </p>
        <pre class="font-mono text-[12px] md:text-[12.5px] leading-[1.65] text-ink whitespace-pre-wrap break-words m-0 flex-1">
<span class="text-muted">&gt;</span> <span class="text-accent">/thinkos-morning</span>

This week (top 3):
  1. v2 ingestion pipeline — cut release
  2. Q3 hiring plan, first draft Friday
  3. clear PR queue (T. + R.)

On your plate today:
  · v2 release notes
  · 1:1 with Priya, 2pm

Calendar: 2 meetings, both afternoon.</pre>
      </article>

      <!-- BEAT 2 — automatic capture -->
      <article class="bg-paper p-6 md:p-7 flex flex-col hover-card">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between border-b border-rule pb-3 mb-3">
          <p class="kicker">14:00 · Midday</p>
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-muted">you typed nothing</p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted mb-4">
          The background job noted where the morning went — folders, file
          counts, a commit hash. Never content.
        </p>
        <pre class="font-mono text-[12px] md:text-[12.5px] leading-[1.65] text-ink whitespace-pre-wrap break-words m-0 flex-1">
<span class="text-muted">// 01 Now/Work Log.md — appended</span>
<span class="text-muted">// automatically by session capture</span>

<span class="text-accent">### 14:00 — acme-redesign</span>
- Edited 12 files in ~/code/acme-redesign
- 2 sessions in this directory
- HEAD: <span class="text-muted">`a1b2c3d`</span>

<span class="text-muted">// listed in the ledger; removable with</span>
<span class="text-muted">// /thinkos-undo-capture</span></pre>
      </article>

      <!-- BEAT 3 — a decision -->
      <article class="bg-paper p-6 md:p-7 flex flex-col hover-card">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between border-b border-rule pb-3 mb-3">
          <p class="kicker">16:30 · A call worth keeping</p>
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-muted">one line</p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted mb-4">
          Automatic capture records <em>that</em> you worked. Conclusions need
          a sentence from you.
        </p>
        <pre class="font-mono text-[12px] md:text-[12.5px] leading-[1.65] text-ink whitespace-pre-wrap break-words m-0 flex-1">
<span class="text-muted">&gt;</span> <span class="text-accent">/thinkos-decide</span> we version the API
<span class="text-muted">&gt;</span> from day one

Logged to 04 Knowledge/Decisions.md —
date, reasoning, and what it applies to.

/thinkos-decisions will surface it the
next time the question comes up.</pre>
      </article>

      <!-- BEAT 4 — Sunday -->
      <article class="bg-paper p-6 md:p-7 flex flex-col hover-card">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between border-b border-rule pb-3 mb-3">
          <p class="kicker">Sunday · 20:00</p>
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-muted">twenty minutes</p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted mb-4">
          When Current Focus expires, every session opens with a one-line
          warning until you run the review.
        </p>
        <pre class="font-mono text-[12px] md:text-[12.5px] leading-[1.65] text-ink whitespace-pre-wrap break-words m-0 flex-1">
<span class="text-muted">CURRENT FOCUS STALE: covers_week ended</span>
<span class="text-muted">2026-06-07 — run /weekly-review</span>

<span class="text-muted">&gt;</span> <span class="text-accent">/weekly-review</span>

Read 7 days of Work Log. Last week's
focus archived. Proposed for next week:
  1. ship ingestion v2.1
  2. onboarding doc for the new hire
  3. close the Q3 hiring loop

Replace Current Focus with this? (y / n)</pre>
      </article>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-baseline md:justify-between gap-4">
      <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-muted">
        Sample vault content — your real vault has your real notes.
      </p>
      <p class="font-mono text-[12px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase">
        <a href="/guide" class="link-anim text-muted">The full rhythm, dos and don'ts included →</a>
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
